WEBVTT

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.170
Soil is my power!

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.540
Impressive as ever, Black Wind.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:29.320
Embraced by the magical tune
played by the Mist...

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.580
Now sleep!

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.430
Silver Etude!

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:00.980
<i>He's gone!</i>

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:06.190
<i>Twelve years ago, the thing that
connected our world with Wonderland,</i>

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:10.660
<i>the Pillar of Darkness, first appeared.</i>

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:15.960
<i>And then, those two giant monsters...</i>

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.410
<i>I've heard that Wonderland is
under the control of the Earl.</i>

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.280
<i>This is Pacifist. Currently...</i>

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:36.490
I can't communicate with the Outside World.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:41.720
All I can do now is to protect these kids.

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:45.160
Is something about to start?

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.900
Or maybe,

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.270
has it already started?

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.200
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.200
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.700
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:27.700
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:36.810
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:36.810
With our eyes on the future

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:42.920
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:42.920
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:52.560
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:52.560
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:00.070
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:00.070
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:05.780
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:05.780
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:15.280
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:15.280
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.930
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.940
This is what I have been able to see.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.780
A Subway that took off...

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.310
Passengers left stranded...

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.940
A new acquaintance...

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.510
A hope for order...

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:45.650
And the one who holds the key to that order...

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:00.130
Now that the Earl knows about this
place, we can't stay here long!

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.070
We've got to relocate to
a different hideout.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:06.730
Wagon number eight is ready!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.810
Tomioka Squad and Yoshimura Squad!
You guys hurry it up!

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:12.310
Leave behind all of the broken machinery!

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:15.350
It'll be fine if we only bring along
the bare essentials!

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.510
Please hurry.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.340
We're going to depart after we eat.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.580
Can't we at least take our time eating?

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.950
I'd really like to do that.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.620
But the Subway won't sit and wait for us.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.150
This is a diagram of the
nearby underground area.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:59.890
The waterways are really
quite big, aren't they?

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.520
If my predictions are correct,

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.190
then this Wonderland Watch,
Isabelle, will show us...

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:10.410
The Subway's next stop should
be this point right here.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.170
So if we can pass through the waterways,

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:15.140
we can catch up with the train, right?!

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.370
That's correct!

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.380
Ouch! Ouch!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:24.550
But because Wonderland
is constantly changing,

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.820
it's hard to precisely calculate
the exact location.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:45.560
This is the culmination of all of my
sweat and skill, Catherine!

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.500
Wow!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:54.480
She is equipped with a highly mobile engine,
capable of handling every situation.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.450
It is loaded with two Elenium Condensers!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:02.610
Water in Wonderland has a high concentration
of the energy substance called Elenium.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:07.720
Catherine takes that, and through a
remarkable system, uses it for propulsive power.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.700
When compared to similarly shaped
Soil-powered ships,

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.700
this girl is over thirty percent lighter!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.110
It only runs on the underground waterways,

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:24.740
but innovative advancements have been made
in her movement ability and energy efficiency!

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:28.480
Catherine is the ultimate in
above-water transportation!

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.410
Good grief, not again.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.280
Knave?

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.690
Be sure and return to us soon.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:43.490
You're the backbone of all our combat ability.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:49.500
I understand. All I want to do is check
on the Subway with my own eyes.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.670
Here you go, this is your food supply.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:58.410
This much stuff?!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:06:59.480
Thank you!

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:03.410
Sooner or later, we may meet somewhere again.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.820
Take care.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.320
Thank you for all of your help.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:11.980
Poshepocket?

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.830
You idiot! What do you think you're doing?!

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.700
Come on, spit it back up!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:39.350
Poshepocket has calmed down a bit, hasn't he?

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:43.450
He cut our luggage in half.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.330
Catherine, launching!

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.310
Thanks for everything!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.440
Goodbye!

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.580
Sorry! I'm gonna chow down on this!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.410
My backpack!

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.470
Oh, so he died?

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:34.400
That is what we suspect.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.980
Makenshi is way too strong.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:42.580
And I wanted another chance to
pick on that Magun guy too.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.650
Your Excellency!

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:54.060
What about the remaining scum of
that underground organization?

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.790
Do whatever you like with them, Fungus.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.190
Oh, that's so nice of you.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:06.800
I'm in a good mood today.

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.370
Now that I have finally returned
to my original size,

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.500
you can trust me to take care of them!

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:28.050
I wonder where Kaze went off to?

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.460
That guy with the gun?

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:36.870
Look, Yu, I think he took his own route.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:42.500
So we have to keep going straight
toward our goal, right?

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.200
Right.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:46.850
That's right...

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.540
To reach the goal of our ideals.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.720
<i>I know nothing of ideals.</i>

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:58.090
<i>I could care less about what happens to the
world, or how many people have to die!</i>

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:11.700
No way!

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.110
It's one of the Earl's henchmen!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:26.020
I am Fungus, one of the Four Lords of Gaudium!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.080
You must be survivors of the
underground organization!

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.850
I'll make you lead me back to your rebel base!

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.490
He didn't really die?!

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.260
Do you plan on attacking
everyone in the Comodeen?

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.930
We've got no choice but to follow a
different route than we'd planned.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:43.030
I'm going to lead him over this way!

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:46.730
Viking! Fire the solution!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.680
I'm going to kill you!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:23.440
<i>You should not have awakened.</i>

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:34.990
Why...

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:38.750
Why didn't it move?

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:51.960
He's coming! He's after us!

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:54.670
Not so fast, you!

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:56.740
This is where we'll put up our fight!

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:59.370
Elenium Wire, launch!

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.250
A clever trick!

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:09.410
This is nothing!

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.680
Elenium Electromagnetic Shock, initiate!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.730
All right!

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:23.670
That is but one of Catherine's
seven secret devices.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:28.230
The special wire actives the
Elenium energy in the water.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.910
All right! Go!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.620
I'm going to have to examine
the strength of that wire.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:40.990
Here he comes!

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.750
Hey! Hey, watch out in front!

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.590
A waterfall!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:52.100
We're going over!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.540
Wings, activate!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.720
You little...

00:13:24.170 --> 00:13:26.900
I'm not finished with you yet!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.870
Deploying Hyper Hooks!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.180
Thank you, Chocobo!

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.850
It looks like we've been separated
quite a ways from our path.

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:52.520
I've got to recalculate our route.

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:57.120
I'm so carsick.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.930
It's because you got carried away.

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:11.810
I'm back!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.280
This will be your graveyard!

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:30.860
Chocobo said the subway is going to leave!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.160
It can't!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:36.030
Nobody puts a dent in my Catherine.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:39.070
You must have some kind of death wish!

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:44.010
Cid?

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:50.950
You will soon witness the power of my wrath!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:01.950
Ultimate Hammer!

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:20.950
It's going to take more than this!

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.960
Isabelle, the Wonderland Watch,
went off, didn't she?

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.840
Well then, let's hurry up!

00:15:56.650 --> 00:15:58.710
The Subway is probably up there.

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:08.120
Hurry!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.120
Cid?!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.130
Please go on ahead.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:21.830
I couldn't bear to leave Catherine
here with such damage.

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:23.210
But...

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.500
The Subway is going to leave!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.650
Cid, thank you so much for everything.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.550
The Subway is up here!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.410
I can't be stopped!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:57.070
Sis...

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:02.980
I'm going to kill you!

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.580
What?! You...

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:12.480
Kaze!

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:15.190
So you survived?

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:23.530
It has moved.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:25.730
You should have been dead long ago!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:29.510
Now's our chance. Hurry!

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.780
Soil is my power!

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.620
The Magun has thawed.

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:19.020
Are you really going to
shoot me with the Magun?

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:23.720
In a confined place like this, we'll all die!

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.330
The appropriate Soil to use
against you has been decided!

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:34.670
The sleep that wraps death,
Steel Gray!

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:45.290
Bubbling and boiling blood,
Heat Crimson!

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:54.190
And finally, the light that penetrates
darkness, Lightning Yellow!

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:10.740
Howl! I summon you, lxion!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.040
Are you sure? Are you really sure?!

00:19:57.620 --> 00:19:58.750
Oh, no!

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:13.600
Catherine... Your memory will
live on forever in my heart.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:18.270
I thought I was going to die!

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:26.450
I'm so tired!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:33.990
I wonder if Cid and Kaze are all right?

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.090
I know.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.700
I don't care how selfish he may be.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.360
I still hope he's alive.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.300
Alive...

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
Nodo ga karakara desu

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.720
I am so thirsty

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
Taihen nan desu

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.080
It's really getting bad

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
Kono mune ookaji desu

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:59.210
It's burning up inside of me

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
Kimi wo hitome mita

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.560
My heart skipped a beat

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
Shunkan bibi tto kita

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:05.460
When I laid eyes on you

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
Goumon no you desu

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:07.130
It's just like torture

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
Taekirenai desu

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.560
I can't take it

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Kimi ni koi shite kara

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.590
Ever since I fell in love with you

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
Itsumo kimi to nita

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.070
My heart skips a beat whenever

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
Kamigata ni ha to suru

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:16.560
I see a girl with hair like yours

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Douka kamisama

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:20.640
Please, God

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Kono boku ni tsubasa kudasai yo

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.950
Can you please give me wings?

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
Kore kare kimi dake wo motto tsuyoku

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:28.480
From now on, my thoughts of you

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Omotchatte kirakira

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.110
Will only shine and grow stronger

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
Tsutaetai koto ippai

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:34.120
There's so much I want to tell you

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
Jikan ga tarinai nai ai ai

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:37.120
There's not enough time left in the world

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
Boku no hitomi ni wa mou

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:39.960
You are now the only person

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
Kimi shika utsuranai

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.300
That my eyes can see

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.000
Kitai wa kore kara

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:45.000
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.200
Nani kara nani made omoikitchatte

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.200
All of these thoughts are too much for me

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.140
Sa subete wo butsukeyou

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.140
So I'm just going to spill my guts

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:57.110
Seikai wa dare ni mo wakanai ai ai ai ai

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:57.110
Nobody knows the right answer

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:59.910
Atama no naka de wa mou

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:59.910
I'm already celebrating my joy

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.280
Shukufuku no kurakkaa

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.280
On the inside

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:05.250
Nani ka ga hajimaru

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:05.250
Something is going to start

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.990
Kitai wa kore kara

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.990
Now I've got my hopes set high

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:12.090
Nozomi wo mochimashou

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:12.090
Let's never lose sight of our dreams

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:13.460
All right!

00:22:12.090 --> 00:22:13.460
All right!

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.660
Final Fantasy: Unlimited

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:24.800
Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.340 --> 00:22:27.600
After crossing the desert of flames,

00:22:27.710 --> 00:22:29.900
the travelers search for an oasis.

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:34.910
When Ai's heart stops, Lisa's heart
begins to burst in compassion.

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:43.920
Next time, I will return to offer you
my Unlimited guidance.
